WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.160
[Engine coughs. Energy hum builds.]

00:01.160 --> 00:02.400
[Engine catches and revs.]

00:02.400 --> 00:04.200
[Tires squeal through water.]

00:04.200 --> 00:05.480
[A rising engine roar and rushing air.]

00:05.480 --> 00:06.640
[A heavy collision. Tires scatter.]

00:06.640 --> 00:07.420
[Quiet.]

00:07.420 --> 00:09.600
[A loose wheel rattles and rolls away.]
